== Effect ==
* Upon use, Isaac farts, dealing 5 damage and [[poison]]ing any enemies within close range for 6 ticks.
** {{dlc|na}} The poison deals 3.5 damage per tick.
** {{dlc|a}} The poison deals Isaac's tear damage.
** The area of effect is 2 tiles in all directions.
** {{dlc|r}} The fart also has knockback and deflects enemy projectiles with deflected projectiles dealing 6 damage if they would've hurt Isaac for half a heart, and 7 for a full heart.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Bird's Eye}}/{{i|Ghost Pepper}}: Poison farts shoot a fire behind Isaac. Two flames will be shot if Isaac also has {{I|Car Battery}}.
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns wisps surrounded by green stink clouds on the outer ring. The wisps deal 5 damage and poison nearby enemies when destroyed.}}
* {{i|Car Battery}}: Deals double damage, but the [[status effect]] lasts for the same amount of time.
* {{t|Gigante Bean}}: The fart deals 10 additional damage.

== Interactions ==
* {{t|Second Hand}}: The poison duration is not affected.

